The Din-Rail Circuit Breaker CB432-DP is a device with wattage (W) and kilowatt hours (kWh) measurement functions. It allows you to control special zone On/Off status as well as to check real-time energy usage wirelessly via your mobile App.

## Key Features

- ZigBee 3.0, works with any standard ZigBee hub
- Double-break relay — neutral and live wire disconnection
- Energy consumption measuring (W and kWh)
- 50A maximum load current
- Extends the range and strengthens ZigBee network communication
